The \texttt{fddiagram} package provides a declarative interface for
typesetting functional dependency diagrams, a central concept in
relational database theory and normalization, directly in \LaTeX.
The author writes dependencies in near-mathematical notation
inside an environment; the package derives the attribute universe,
computes all positions, and produces a \TikZ-based diagram automatically.
No \TikZ\ knowledge is required.
The package is implemented in \LaTeX3 and is available at
\url{https://ctan.org/pkg/fddiagram} and in \TeX\ Live.
